 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "expression is an integer literal or a parenthesised call \"(op e1 e2 ... ek)\" with op \"add\" or \"mul\" and k >= 2 argument expressions. Tokens are separated by one or more spaces, spaces next to parentheses and at either end are optional. Literals are an optional \"-\" followed by decimal digits without leading zeros (absolute value at most 1e9, no \"-0\"). add returns the sum and mul the product of the arguments. Return the integer value of the whole expression.",
